1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,093
A worked item.

2
00:00:01,093 --> 00:00:04,205
The principal was giving the students certificates.

3
00:00:04,205 --> 00:00:11,341
The verb was giving is past continuous, so the passive frame is was or were being plus the past participle.

4
00:00:11,341 --> 00:00:16,666
There are two objects; prefer the person, the students, as the new subject.

5
00:00:16,666 --> 00:00:19,140
Students is plural, so were.

6
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:22,864
The students were being given certificates by the principal.

